          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+space"} topological space
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            is
            %strong sober
            if its
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/points"} points
            are exactly determined by its
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice+of+open+subsets"} lattice of open subsets
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/continuous+map"} continuous map
                from
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi X
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
                to the space of points of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locale"} locale
                that it gives rise to (see there for details) is a
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homeomorphism"} homeomorphism
            %li
